00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:46,000
The Great Hack is a documentary film directed by Karim Amer.

3
00:19:00,000 --> 00:19:06,000
Data—arguably the world’s most valuable asset—is being
weaponized to wage cultural and political wars.

4
00:25:20,000 --> 00:25:26,000
The dark world of data exploitation is uncovered through the unpredictable, personal journeys of
players on different sides of the explosive Cambridge Analytica/Facebook data story.

5
